  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "Right, welcome back.",
      "startMs": 0,
      "endMs": 1115
    },
    {
      "text": "Fuck, I have been waiting three weeks to talk about this one.",
      "startMs": 1155,
      "endMs": 5735
    },
    {
      "text": "Grab a drink and settle in because we are going long today.",
      "startMs": 5775,
      "endMs": 10355
    },
    {
      "text": "The patch notes dropped on Tuesday and honestly the first read was fine.",
      "startMs": 10395,
      "endMs": 15360
    },
    {
      "text": "Nothing alarming.",
      "startMs": 15400,
      "endMs": 16130
    },
    {
      "text": "Then people started testing it and the wheels came off almost immediately.",
      "startMs": 16170,
      "endMs": 20750
    },
    {
      "text": "So let me walk you through what actually happened and why the studio response has been so strange.",
      "startMs": 20790,
      "endMs": 27680
    },
    {
      "text": "First the timeline.",
      "startMs": 27720,
      "endMs": 28835
    },
    {
      "text": "On Tuesday morning the notes go up.",
      "startMs": 28875,
      "endMs": 31530
    },
    {
      "text": "By lunchtime three separate creators have reproduced the bug on stream.",
      "startMs": 31570,
      "endMs": 35765
    },
    {
      "text": "By Tuesday night it is trending.",
      "startMs": 35805,
      "endMs": 38075
    },
    {
      "text": "Now here is where it gets stupid.",
      "startMs": 38115,
      "endMs": 40770
    },
    {
      "text": "What the hell is this.",
      "startMs": 40810,
      "endMs": 42695
    },
    {
      "text": "Are you shitting me.",
      "startMs": 42735,
      "endMs": 44235
    },
    {
      "text": "This is the same shit they pulled last season and the exact same shit the season before that and I am so tired of it.",
      "startMs": 44275,
      "endMs": 53860
    },
    {
      "text": "It is the same fucking bug.",
      "startMs": 53900,
      "endMs": 56170
    },
    {
      "text": "The same fucking bug, shipped twice, in the same fucking quarter, and not one fucking person at that studio thought to check.",
      "startMs": 56210,
      "endMs": 64640
    },
    {
      "text": "Absolute shit show.",
      "startMs": 64680,
      "endMs": 65795
    },
    {
      "text": "Anyway.",
      "startMs": 65835,
      "endMs": 66180
    },
    {
      "text": "Let me calm down and get back to the actual analysis because there is a serious point underneath all of this.",
      "startMs": 66220,
      "endMs": 74265
    },
    {
      "text": "The engineering culture question is real and it is worth taking seriously.",
      "startMs": 74305,
      "endMs": 78885
    },
    {
      "text": "Moving on to the second thing I wanted to cover.",
      "startMs": 78925,
      "endMs": 82735
    },
    {
      "text": "There was a shooting reported near the venue on Saturday and the community response has been genuinely difficult to watch.",
      "startMs": 82775,
      "endMs": 90435
    },
    {
      "text": "The gunman was named on Sunday.",
      "startMs": 90475,
      "endMs": 92745
    },
    {
      "text": "The death toll has been revised twice since then and the victims are still being identified.",
      "startMs": 92785,
      "endMs": 98905
    },
    {
      "text": "A memorial has been set up outside and the tragedy has understandably overshadowed everything else that happened that weekend.",
      "startMs": 98945,
      "endMs": 106220
    },
    {
      "text": "I want to be careful here because there are families involved.",
      "startMs": 106260,
      "endMs": 110455
    },
    {
      "text": "So that is where things stand.",
      "startMs": 110495,
      "endMs": 112765
    },
    {
      "text": "Let me know what you think in the comments and I will see you in the next one.",
      "startMs": 112805,
      "endMs": 119695
    }
  ]
